1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,250
Kak, kenapa sih kalau sholat

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,100
kita harus menghadap kiblat?

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,150
Kiblat itu arah ke Ka'bah,

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,050
di kota Makkah.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,750
Allah memerintahkan kita

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,350
menghadap ke sana setiap kali sholat.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,150
Dari Indonesia, Ka'bah jauh sekali.

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,350
Hampir 8.000 km, ke arah barat laut.

9
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,050
Tahukah kamu?

10
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,850
Saat sholat, umat Islam

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,250
di seluruh dunia menghadap

12
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,150
ke satu titik yang sama: Ka'bah.

13
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,950
Wah, jadi kita semua kompak, ya, Kak!

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,750
Misi hari ini:

15
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,750
cari tahu arah kiblat di rumahmu, ya!

16
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,550
Besok kita cari tahu,

17
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,150
kenapa baca bismillah sebelum makan?
